OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Gun out to beat Littler for
OL,4,A#501k darts prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year old darts player is set to
OL,7,Ftake on Luke Littler in a live darts
OL,8,Fshowdown for a shot at #501,000.
OL,10,FJayden Walker, from Christchurch,
OL,11,FDorset, is one of 24 players picked for
OL,12,FBeat Luke Littler, a live Netflix show
OL,13,Fin which contestants take on the world
OL,14,Fchampion in a single leg of 501 unless
OL,15,Fsomeone beats him ending the challenge.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
