OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Gun out to beat Littler for
OL,4,A#501k darts prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FJayden, whose playing nickname is The
OL,7,FYoung Gun, has played Littler twice, he
OL,8,Fsaid: "He beat me 3-0 the first time...
OL,9,Fhe was on fire, then the second time I
OL,10,Flost 2-1 but I won the first leg so I
OL,11,Fgot the leg I need tonight to win the
OL,12,Fmoney."
OL,14,FAhead of the live show in Manchester at
OL,15,F19:00 GMT on Friday he said he was
OL,16,F"excited... but then also a little bit
OL,17,Fnervous".
